---
<Layout {...meta} mainClass="flex-1">
<nav aria-label="Migas de pan" class="border-b border-border/70 bg-secondary/40"><ol class="mx-auto flex max-w-[72rem] flex-wrap items-center gap-1 px-6 py-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><li><a class="transition-colors hover:text-primary" href="/">Inicio</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3 w-3 shrink-0 opacity-60"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><a class="transition-colors hover:text-primary" href="/legal">Legal</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3 w-3 shrink-0 opacity-60"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span aria-current="page" class="text-foreground/80">Política de privacidad</span></li></ol></nav><section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[hsl(var(--ink))] text-white"><div aria-hidden="true" class="grid-lines absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.07]"></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[72rem] px-6 py-16 sm:py-24"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary-foreground/70">Legal</p><h1 class="mt-4 max-w-[44rem] font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.9rem]">Política de privacidad</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-[44rem] text-base leading-relaxed text-white/70 sm:text-lg">Cómo tratamos los datos personales que nos facilitas a través de los formularios de este sitio web.</p></div></section><div class="mx-auto max-w-[72rem] space-y-16 px-6 py-16 sm:space-y-20 sm:py-20"><div class="" data-reveal><section><div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,22rem)_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-12"><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[hsl(var(--ink))] sm:text-3xl">Responsable del tratamiento</h2><div class="space-y-4 text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"><p>Coolnetworks, Zaragoza (España). Correo de contacto para privacidad: info@coolnetworks.it. Datos identificativos completos pendientes de cumplimentar por el titular.</p></div></div></section></div><div class="" data-reveal><section><div><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[hsl(var(--ink))] sm:text-3xl">Información sobre el tratamiento</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-[46rem] text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Los formularios de diagnóstico y contacto recogen datos de contacto profesional y la información que decidas facilitar sobre tu empresa. Estructura preparada para los textos definitivos:</p><ul class="mt-8 grid gap-x-10 gap-y-0 sm:grid-cols-2"><li class="flex gap-3 border-t border-border py-4 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Finalidades del tratamiento (atender solicitudes, elaborar propuestas)</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 border-t border-border py-4 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Base jurídica del tratamiento</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 border-t border-border py-4 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Plazos de conservación</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 border-t border-border py-4 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Destinatarios y encargados de tratamiento</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 border-t border-border py-4 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Transferencias internacionales, si aplican</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 border-t border-border py-4 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Derechos de acceso, rectificación, supresión, oposición, limitación y portabilidad</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 border-t border-border py-4 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Reclamación ante la Agencia Española de Protección de Datos</span></li></ul></div></section></div><div class="" data-reveal><section><div class="flex gap-4 border-l-2 border-primary bg-secondary/60 p-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg><div><h2 class="font-display text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Aviso</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/80">Los textos definitivos deben ser revisados por asesoría jurídica y adaptados a los tratamientos reales de la empresa.</p></div></div></section></div></div>
</Layout>
